# The lockfile is generated locally and not committed: this repository is pushed
# through an API path with a payload budget that a 200 KB lockfile does not fit.
# Every direct dependency in package.json is pinned to an exact version instead,
# .npmrc sets save-exact, and CI asserts the installed tree matches the manifest
# (scripts/assert-pinned-deps.mjs).
